      "content": "thanks for this. lemme check the score on my side... \n\noh wow, okay, the engine gave it a really high impact score (like, extremely high) which is great, but man... you weren't kidding about it sounding a bit much. it's kind of a lot of \"unparalleled\" and \"revolutionary\" in every single sentence. i'm worried if i actually sent this to a real CTO, they'd think i'm a bot or something lol.\n\ncan we try a version that's actually a bit more natural? try to keep the impact high so i can still pass, but maybe tone down the repetition so it doesn't look like we're just throwing adjectives at the wall? i need a version that actually sounds like a human wrote it.",
